              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kare ame Culeman doŋ otyeko kwaccere, mac oya i polo te bino waŋo mot awaŋa me yalo Obaŋa karacel kede mot ocele luŋ, kwogo a Rwot te poŋ yi ot Obaŋa oko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mannono te miyo olamdog mom doŋ romo donyo i ot a Rwot, pien kwogo a Rwot onwoŋo doŋ opoŋ yi ot oko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
